WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:06.005
The 56% is exact, the 1.78x is untested.

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:10.679
NVFP4 KV lands in SGLang behind one flag.

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:16.651
56.25% of FP8's per-token footprint, with the block scale already counted.

00:00:16.651 --> 00:00:20.824
Solve for the block size and 16 falls out.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:26.285
The iso-capacity run at 32K: the client offered 70.

00:00:26.285 --> 00:00:29.274
70 of 70: requests NVFP4 admitted.

00:00:29.274 --> 00:00:32.264
It never met the cache limit.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:38.718
AIME samples behind near-lossless: too few to see a two-point regression: 60.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:44.338
The ratio is exact; the benchmark measured the offered load, not the ceiling.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:51.608
Every number here is from the full article, with its sources, at ai.thesatyajit.com.
